# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# The build emits privacy.html and terms.html; these serve them at clean URLs
# without the extension, which is what the canonical tags and the sitemap
# claim. Status 200 rewrites rather than 301 redirects, so the address bar
# keeps the clean URL.
/privacy    /privacy.html    200
/terms      /terms.html      200

# Anything else is a genuine 404 — served with a real 404 status, not a 200.
# A "soft 404" (missing page returned as OK) gets the wrong URLs indexed.
/*          /404.html        404
